<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DepoTech raised by UBS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DepoTech raised by UBS.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said analyst Marc Ostro upgraded his rating on DepoTech Corp to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- In a report, cited conviction that the U.S. Food and Drug Administration will rapidly approve DeopTech's DepoCyt drug and also the stock's fall to an &quot;absurdly low&quot; valuation.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3/4 to 15.</p>
</text>
